  "description": "A high-performance .NET library that extends Emgu.CV (OpenCV wrapper) with zero-copy Span/Memory Mat accessors, async stream copy helpers, ROI utilities, pluggable Mat compression (PNG, Deflate, GZip, ZLib, Brotli, Zstd), CMat for memory-efficient compressed image storage, structured contour hierarchy wrappers, and drawing helpers for polygons and multi-line text rendering.",
